# NQ00Merre "Arbeit in der Mine": Merre, in SchattenrufMinePart07, wants the three rat holes sealed. This quest gates the
# main quest: Merre's reward INFO (0000F20B) sets NQ00Merre 25 and NQ00Karick 5, and Karick's helmet quest is what opens
# the mine wall (MQ01Tate's script returns until NQ00Karick >= 19).
# Stages are TES4 numbers: 5 offered, 10 accepted, 20 holes sealed (NQ00RattenlochPerformanceBox01Script), 25 reward.

# Merre's greeting once Porim has arrived (MQ01Porim 6 or 7) adds "Arbeiten"; "Arbeiten" sets stage 5 and "Natuerlich" sets 10.
case merre_takes_the_job
talk MerreRef
hear 300 MerreRef Ich bin Merre
ask "Arbeiten"
ask "Natürlich"
bye
expect GetStageDone NQ00Merre 10
end

# The player carries each loose brick (NQRatteStaticZiegel0N, grabbed with the Grab key in Oblivion) to its hole;
# the script seals a hole when the brick is within 95 of MarkerRattenloch0NRef and stage 20 is set once all three are
# sealed. Moving the brick stands in for grabbing and carrying it; killing the rats is not required (the hint at nine
# dead rats only sets stage 15).
case merre_seal_the_holes
console Rattenloch01ZiegelRef.moveto MarkerRattenloch01Ref
wait 30
console Rattenloch02ZiegelRef.moveto MarkerRattenloch02Ref
wait 30
console Rattenloch03ZiegelRef.moveto MarkerRattenloch03Ref
until 600 GetStageDone NQ00Merre 20
end

# Merre's greeting at stage 20 pays the reward and sets NQ00Merre 25 and NQ00Karick 5.
case merre_reward
talk MerreRef
hear 300 MerreRef saubere Arbeit
bye
expect GetStageDone NQ00Merre 25
expect GetStageDone NQ00Karick 5
end
